; ==============================================================================
;  classic-demo  -  test theme for config\module-map.rc
;  Names its modules the way a 2002 theme does and, like one, never loads Core.
;  litestep maps label-1.99 to Label through *ModuleAlias and, because a module
;  was mapped, loads Core.dll first by itself (every nModule needs it).
;  geekamp-1.9.7 has no alias and is not installed: it must be skipped and
;  logged, with no "Could not locate module" box.
;  Copy this folder to <run folder>\themes\classic-demo, select it with
;  tools\switch-theme.ps1 and check that Core.dll and Label.dll are loaded, that
;  no dialog box is open and that the box below shows up.
; ==============================================================================
*NetLoadModule label-1.99
*NetLoadModule geekamp-1.9.7

*nLabel ClassicDemo
ClassicDemoX 100
ClassicDemoY 100
ClassicDemoWidth 420
ClassicDemoHeight 60
ClassicDemoColor #FF202040
ClassicDemoFontColor #FFFFFFFF
ClassicDemoFontSize 16
ClassicDemoText "label-1.99 -> Label.dll"
